WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:03.480
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.480 --> 00:06.070
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.740 --> 00:10.140
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.840 --> 00:14.850
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.220 --> 00:17.750
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.090 --> 00:21.530
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.280 --> 00:28.500
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.180 --> 00:34.260
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.060 --> 00:37.550
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.550 --> 00:40.160
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.680 --> 00:47.940
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.910 --> 00:51.670
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.730 --> 00:54.570
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.860 --> 00:55.890
♪Let me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.160
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.610 --> 01:03.290
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.580 --> 01:06.280
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.450 --> 01:07.920
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.920 --> 01:12.090
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.450 --> 01:22.700
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.130 --> 01:29.680
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.880 --> 01:32.789
=Episode 23=

01:35.340 --> 01:36.220
Focus on training.

02:23.300 --> 02:23.820
Feinu.

02:24.780 --> 02:25.940
Go to the capital.

02:26.220 --> 02:27.020
Look into He Rufei.

02:27.900 --> 02:28.420
Commander...

02:28.579 --> 02:29.180
Look into

02:29.180 --> 02:30.380
his days before Mingshui,

02:31.180 --> 02:31.940
and monitor

02:31.940 --> 02:33.020
his every move now.

02:34.340 --> 02:35.030
Understood.

02:40.010 --> 02:45.780
(Xiao)

02:45.780 --> 02:46.300
Mr. He.

02:46.700 --> 02:47.260
You're back.

02:48.420 --> 02:48.940
Mr. Jiang.

02:49.420 --> 02:50.340
May I trouble you

02:50.780 --> 02:51.740
with something?

02:52.579 --> 02:53.860
There is no "trouble".

02:54.260 --> 02:55.260
Just say the word.

02:55.460 --> 02:55.980
No problem.

02:56.579 --> 02:57.740
You escort agents

02:58.140 --> 02:59.500
must have connections.

02:59.860 --> 03:00.500
Could you

03:00.540 --> 03:01.660
figure something out?

03:02.540 --> 03:03.300
Who has visited

03:03.780 --> 03:05.380
Yuhua Temple these years

03:05.740 --> 03:06.540
and met Miss He,

03:06.820 --> 03:08.500
who was resting in the rear courtyard?

03:09.060 --> 03:09.940
Miss He?

03:10.700 --> 03:12.260
He Rufei's little sister.

03:13.060 --> 03:13.940
Mr. Jiang, I know

03:14.260 --> 03:15.420
it sounds abrupt,

03:15.860 --> 03:16.860
but it's important.

03:17.540 --> 03:18.380
Unfortunately,

03:18.860 --> 03:19.540
I can't explain

03:19.540 --> 03:20.380
everything yet.

03:21.260 --> 03:22.380
Escort agents take jobs

03:22.660 --> 03:23.940
without question asked.

03:24.300 --> 03:25.380
Besides, you're my buddy.

03:25.700 --> 03:26.220
Consider it

03:26.380 --> 03:27.020
done.

03:28.820 --> 03:29.660
Thank you.

03:50.500 --> 03:51.500
(Before Mingshui Battle,)

03:52.140 --> 03:53.620
(He Rufei was at the Yuhua Temple.)

03:54.540 --> 03:56.180
(So if He Rufei did meet Xu Jingfu,)

03:56.420 --> 03:57.340
(he must have)

03:57.860 --> 03:59.140
(met him at the Yuhua Temple.)

04:00.220 --> 04:01.620
(Mr. Jiang will be able)

04:01.900 --> 04:02.740
(to confirm that.)

04:04.220 --> 04:05.380
(Though it's not enough)

04:05.660 --> 04:06.820
(to prove He Rufei's)

04:07.060 --> 04:08.700
(involvement in the scheme,)

04:09.900 --> 04:10.580
(at least,)

04:10.580 --> 04:11.620
(it shows the Commander)

04:12.100 --> 04:12.660
(that)

04:12.660 --> 04:14.020
(He Rufei is a suspect.)

04:15.420 --> 04:16.140
(Commander)

04:16.820 --> 04:18.339
(is investigating for sure)

04:18.980 --> 04:20.260
(and may uncover new leads.)

04:26.100 --> 04:26.660
Now,

04:27.420 --> 04:28.900
I just need to hone my skills

04:30.020 --> 04:30.940
and bide my time.

04:32.340 --> 04:32.950
General.

04:33.460 --> 04:34.060
(Stand Tall and See Far)
What's wrong?

04:34.260 --> 04:35.020
I found out that

04:35.180 --> 04:35.740
a formidable

04:35.820 --> 04:37.020
female general fought

04:37.180 --> 04:38.260
alongside Xiao Jue.

04:39.780 --> 04:40.700
A female general?

04:44.060 --> 04:45.100
What is she like?

04:46.180 --> 04:46.980
Extremely skilled

04:47.180 --> 04:47.700
and valiant,

04:48.220 --> 04:49.500
coming from Yezhou Garrison.

04:50.060 --> 04:50.860
At Jiyang,

04:51.100 --> 04:51.860
she single-handedly

04:51.940 --> 04:53.580
killed Wutuo's commander Huyate.

04:56.260 --> 04:56.820
Understood.

05:04.500 --> 05:05.220
Could it

05:06.500 --> 05:07.580
be her?

05:09.660 --> 05:10.620
No way.

05:11.180 --> 05:12.820
She's supposed to be dead.

05:14.780 --> 05:15.980
Better safe

05:16.660 --> 05:17.860
than sorry.

05:19.140 --> 05:20.740
Whether she's He Yan or not,

05:21.500 --> 05:23.300
she has to die.

05:42.860 --> 05:43.580
He.

05:43.860 --> 05:44.420
You've been

05:44.420 --> 05:45.340
running for six hours.

05:45.580 --> 05:47.260
Why don't you take a break?

05:48.260 --> 05:48.940
Yeah.

05:48.940 --> 05:49.940
Get some rest.

05:50.540 --> 05:51.580
If you keep running...

05:52.100 --> 05:53.580
I'm fine. Not tired yet.

05:53.940 --> 05:54.940
Have some water

05:55.260 --> 05:55.820
and eat.

05:57.659 --> 05:58.340
I can skip

05:58.860 --> 05:59.620
a meal.

06:00.020 --> 06:00.900
But you haven't

06:01.300 --> 06:02.100
eaten for ages.

06:02.420 --> 06:02.970
Yeah.

06:03.940 --> 06:04.580
S-Stop...

06:04.860 --> 06:06.020
S-Stop training.

06:06.340 --> 06:07.700
At least eat something

06:07.700 --> 06:08.580
and take a break.

06:08.940 --> 06:09.780
If you keep...

06:10.420 --> 06:11.030
This is...

06:13.700 --> 06:15.380
- S-Stop training.
- He.

06:17.900 --> 06:18.420
He.

06:18.700 --> 06:19.220
Wait.

06:20.940 --> 06:21.700
S-Stop...

06:24.380 --> 06:25.300
Still running?

06:43.659 --> 06:44.460
H-He's...

06:44.460 --> 06:45.340
still training?

06:45.900 --> 06:46.820
Take a break.

06:47.860 --> 06:49.340
I bet he is bothered by something.

06:49.540 --> 06:50.420
That's why

06:50.860 --> 06:51.900
he's tormenting himself.

07:03.980 --> 07:04.780
Mr. Chu.

07:10.020 --> 07:10.540
Miss Xu.

07:13.500 --> 07:14.860
Is this for my father

07:15.380 --> 07:16.140
or me?

07:17.540 --> 07:18.460
I roamed around

07:18.580 --> 07:19.620
during Water God Festival

07:19.940 --> 07:20.900
in Jiyang.

07:21.660 --> 07:22.700
The moment I saw this,

07:23.100 --> 07:23.860
I felt that

07:23.860 --> 07:24.900
it suits you perfectly.

07:25.700 --> 07:27.140
I hope you will accept it.

07:36.380 --> 07:37.740
Courtesy requires a return.

07:38.180 --> 07:39.580
I prepared some pastries.

07:40.020 --> 07:42.020
Would you join me

07:42.260 --> 07:43.460
in the pavilion

07:44.060 --> 07:46.260
to have pastries
while admiring the flowers?

07:46.580 --> 07:47.300
Miss Xu.

07:47.780 --> 07:48.460
I...

07:49.820 --> 07:51.340
haven't paid respects to Master.

07:56.380 --> 07:57.110
But

07:57.460 --> 07:58.740
it won't take

07:58.860 --> 07:59.620
that long.

08:00.300 --> 08:02.020
Perhaps you could go ahead,

08:02.220 --> 08:03.220
and I'll join you

08:03.420 --> 08:04.020
very soon.

08:05.180 --> 08:05.720
Alright.

08:06.940 --> 08:07.700
See you later.

08:18.060 --> 08:18.900
Zilan.

08:19.660 --> 08:21.940
You're usually reliable,

08:22.420 --> 08:24.700
but you have truly disappointed me

08:25.180 --> 08:27.420
with this mission in Jiyang.

08:32.299 --> 08:32.860
Master.

08:33.260 --> 08:34.380
I failed to kill Chai Anxi,

08:34.780 --> 08:35.860
in fear of

08:36.340 --> 08:37.580
alerting our enemies.

08:39.780 --> 08:42.100
What did Chai Anxi say?

08:44.220 --> 08:45.220
He told Xiao Jue

08:45.260 --> 08:46.460
what happened in Mingshui.

08:47.220 --> 08:48.260
He said He Rufei

08:48.740 --> 08:49.420
made him withhold

08:49.460 --> 08:50.540
Xiao Zhongwu's letter.

08:58.900 --> 08:59.940
That's all?

09:07.420 --> 09:09.900
Now that he's learned my deepest secret,

09:10.260 --> 09:12.660
he won't tell the truth.

09:13.180 --> 09:15.540
He'll be scared that I'd silence him,

09:16.220 --> 09:16.860
or

09:17.220 --> 09:19.180
he'll try to blackmail me.

09:20.780 --> 09:22.660
If he doesn't tell the truth,

09:24.700 --> 09:26.140
I will drop the bracelet,

09:26.500 --> 09:27.620
and you shall kill him.

09:28.580 --> 09:29.100
Understood.

09:42.460 --> 09:43.140
He also said

09:45.100 --> 09:45.860
that you

09:46.820 --> 09:48.140
were the mastermind

09:48.220 --> 09:48.980
of the scheme.

10:11.500 --> 10:13.060
Aren't you scared

10:13.980 --> 10:16.540
I'd silence you
because of what you said?

10:20.980 --> 10:22.500
I've always wanted to earn

10:22.500 --> 10:23.420
your utmost trust.

10:24.740 --> 10:26.300
But my limitations

10:26.980 --> 10:27.940
made my goal

10:28.020 --> 10:28.740
impossible.

10:29.700 --> 10:31.460
This has long troubled me.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.820
Now that I know your secret,

10:34.460 --> 10:35.180
I see it as

10:36.500 --> 10:37.340
a double-edged sword.

10:38.900 --> 10:40.460
Though you may silence me

10:40.660 --> 10:41.420
as a precaution,

10:42.100 --> 10:43.780
I feel more joy than worry,

10:44.380 --> 10:45.780
for I'll defend this secret

10:45.820 --> 10:46.860
with my life,

10:47.980 --> 10:49.500
which bonds us deeper.

10:50.980 --> 10:51.860
I believe

10:52.620 --> 10:53.660
that I am finally

10:54.540 --> 10:55.300
qualified

10:55.300 --> 10:56.180
to earn your trust

10:56.300 --> 10:57.340
and share your burdens.

11:11.100 --> 11:11.860
Zilan.

11:12.660 --> 11:14.820
I was joking with you.

11:15.380 --> 11:16.220
But I wasn't

11:16.300 --> 11:17.300
joking with you.

11:20.140 --> 11:21.540
I failed the mission.

11:22.860 --> 11:23.860
I'll find a way

11:23.900 --> 11:24.620
to make amends.

11:25.260 --> 11:26.460
Do you have a plan?

11:29.540 --> 11:30.780
Though Chai Anxi is dead,

11:31.460 --> 11:33.060
Xiao Jue won't let this go.

11:33.940 --> 11:34.620
In my opinion,

11:35.180 --> 11:36.660
He Rufei was the perpetrator,

11:37.580 --> 11:38.260
and it had

11:38.620 --> 11:39.900
nothing to do with you.

11:41.340 --> 11:41.980
I bet Xiao Jue

11:42.140 --> 11:43.540
will investigate He Rufei first.

11:44.180 --> 11:45.180
Once we inform He Rufei

11:45.220 --> 11:46.140
about this,

11:46.780 --> 11:48.100
he will surely make a move.

11:50.180 --> 11:51.380
Xiao Jue wants trouble.

11:51.980 --> 11:53.140
Then he can have it.

11:54.180 --> 11:55.140
He left Yezhou

11:55.380 --> 11:56.660
without permission.

11:57.020 --> 11:58.340
We can't let it slide.

11:59.300 --> 11:59.860
Also,

12:00.260 --> 12:01.060
a young officer

12:01.540 --> 12:02.940
performed remarkably well

12:03.140 --> 12:04.380
in the Jiyang Battle.

12:05.100 --> 12:06.460
Considering their contributions,

12:07.020 --> 12:07.860
if this officer

12:07.980 --> 12:09.460
receives rewards

12:09.980 --> 12:10.860
while Commander Xiao

12:11.140 --> 12:12.060
faces punishment,

12:12.660 --> 12:14.020
the veteran troops will surely

12:14.060 --> 12:15.340
grow discontent.

12:15.580 --> 12:16.700
When conflicts arise,

12:17.100 --> 12:18.020
it will make Xiao Jue

12:18.420 --> 12:19.420
look incompetent

12:19.860 --> 12:20.380
in leading

12:21.020 --> 12:21.660
the troops.

12:24.140 --> 12:25.700
That's what you're thinking?

12:27.220 --> 12:28.780
You should know.

12:29.420 --> 12:31.900
If this gets out,

12:32.220 --> 12:35.220
it would be a felony.

12:37.580 --> 12:39.300
Your guidance has been vital to me.

12:39.940 --> 12:40.620
Without you,

12:40.980 --> 12:42.180
I wouldn't be here today.

12:43.500 --> 12:44.940
I swear I'll eliminate

12:45.300 --> 12:46.340
all threats

12:46.380 --> 12:47.100
to you,

12:47.180 --> 12:47.740
even if

12:49.620 --> 12:50.700
it costs me

12:50.900 --> 12:52.020
my very life.

13:14.420 --> 13:15.220
Father.

13:17.660 --> 13:18.420
Father.

13:26.700 --> 13:27.380
Pingting.

13:27.740 --> 13:28.780
What brings you here?

13:29.420 --> 13:30.740
Can't I just check on you?

13:33.260 --> 13:33.820
Father.

13:33.980 --> 13:35.540
Why did you make Mr. Chu kneel?

13:35.820 --> 13:37.220
What did he do wrong?

13:38.060 --> 13:39.540
Let him get up.

13:39.700 --> 13:40.260
I'm waiting

13:40.300 --> 13:41.460
to see flowers with him.

13:42.300 --> 13:43.300
Naughty girl.

13:44.340 --> 13:45.940
I have important matters

13:46.900 --> 13:48.260
to discuss with Zilan.

13:49.780 --> 13:50.580
Father,

13:51.180 --> 13:52.020
flower viewing

13:52.180 --> 13:53.100
is also important.

13:55.580 --> 13:56.420
Father.

14:03.980 --> 14:05.260
Help me up.

14:06.260 --> 14:06.900
Come on.

14:08.380 --> 14:08.900
Be careful.

14:11.100 --> 14:13.380
I've said my piece.

14:15.660 --> 14:16.500
Understood.

14:20.460 --> 14:21.080
Go ahead.

14:22.780 --> 14:23.460
Thank you.

14:33.820 --> 14:34.390
Master,

14:34.860 --> 14:36.020
I have one more question.

14:36.420 --> 14:37.380
Please enlighten me.

14:38.660 --> 14:39.460
What is it?

14:39.780 --> 14:41.180
What should I tell His Majesty

14:41.660 --> 14:42.580
tomorrow?

14:45.740 --> 14:46.460
Zilan,

14:47.660 --> 14:50.780
His Majesty bears the world
on his shoulders.

14:51.500 --> 14:52.860
As his ministers,

14:53.060 --> 14:55.540
we must share his burdens.

14:55.860 --> 14:57.260
We don't have to

14:57.820 --> 14:59.860
trouble him
with all the trivial matters.

15:01.140 --> 15:01.750
Yes, Master.

15:02.740 --> 15:03.340
I

15:04.500 --> 15:05.060
understand.

15:19.620 --> 15:21.820
Tomorrow, someone will bring you

15:22.140 --> 15:25.020
the cure I found for you.

15:25.540 --> 15:27.660
Will you remain here,

15:27.940 --> 15:30.500
as a caged bird in shadows,

15:31.060 --> 15:32.420
or go out there

15:32.620 --> 15:35.100
as the mighty General Feihong?

15:36.020 --> 15:37.620
Think carefully.

15:43.380 --> 15:44.060
General Feihong.

15:44.340 --> 15:44.900
Just a second.

15:45.100 --> 15:45.780
Let me inform...

15:45.980 --> 15:46.540
Step aside.

15:46.660 --> 15:47.380
Master.

15:47.380 --> 15:48.060
Master.

15:48.380 --> 15:50.100
- Master.
- Chancellor.

15:54.060 --> 15:55.340
General Feihong.

15:55.660 --> 15:57.300
This is my mansion.

15:57.900 --> 15:59.860
How dare you

15:59.900 --> 16:01.180
barge in like this?

16:03.380 --> 16:04.260
I apologize.

16:04.540 --> 16:06.540
But this is urgent.

16:07.180 --> 16:08.500
Xiao Jue achieved military merits

16:08.500 --> 16:09.260
in Jiyang again.

16:09.500 --> 16:10.740
Doesn't it mean that he will

16:10.900 --> 16:12.020
regain influence?

16:15.100 --> 16:17.100
I thought it was something urgent.

16:17.340 --> 16:19.860
He just won a battle, that's all.

16:20.220 --> 16:22.700
Do you have to be so scared?

16:23.260 --> 16:23.860
Get up.

16:27.940 --> 16:28.780
However,

16:29.060 --> 16:31.420
I did hear something.

16:31.740 --> 16:34.020
Chai Anxi didn't die

16:34.220 --> 16:35.620
at Mingshui.

16:35.860 --> 16:36.860
Xiao Jue found him

16:37.140 --> 16:38.980
two days ago.

16:41.340 --> 16:42.460
T-Then...

16:42.940 --> 16:43.700
What should I do?

16:43.940 --> 16:45.540
Xiao Jue will bring him

16:45.700 --> 16:46.780
to His Majesty.

16:47.260 --> 16:48.260
Help me, Chancellor.

16:49.060 --> 16:50.020
Rest easy.

16:50.500 --> 16:51.460
I've already

16:51.460 --> 16:53.060
dealt with it.

16:53.500 --> 16:55.380
Chai Anxi is dead.

16:55.860 --> 16:56.940
He won't be coming.

16:57.860 --> 16:58.700
But Xiao Jue

16:58.740 --> 17:00.420
won't let this go.

17:00.540 --> 17:02.500
He'll keep searching for evidence.

17:02.820 --> 17:05.060
You must be careful

17:05.500 --> 17:08.380
not to leave any traces behind.

17:08.780 --> 17:09.819
After all,

17:10.020 --> 17:12.180
the one who contacted Chai Anxi

17:13.260 --> 17:14.619
was you.

17:30.660 --> 17:31.540
Rest assured.

17:31.980 --> 17:32.660
I won't

17:33.140 --> 17:33.980
let Xiao Jue

17:34.060 --> 17:35.220
get any dirt on me.

17:35.700 --> 17:36.660
Good.

17:37.820 --> 17:38.500
After all,

17:38.860 --> 17:42.220
military promotions
hinge on battlefield merits.

17:43.060 --> 17:44.940
Xiao Jue is brave and smart.

17:45.220 --> 17:48.140
Halting his ascension

17:50.340 --> 17:52.540
poses genuine difficulty.

17:53.700 --> 17:55.260
Then let's end it at once.

17:55.820 --> 17:56.380
Chancellor.

17:56.700 --> 17:58.180
Why don't we work with Wutuo

17:58.380 --> 18:00.180
and do what we did
to Xiao Zhongwu again?

18:10.660 --> 18:11.540
Rest assured.

18:12.220 --> 18:13.340
I've devised a plan.

18:19.220 --> 18:21.260
Let's ally with Wutuo

18:21.420 --> 18:22.580
to create a diversion.

18:23.020 --> 18:24.300
They'll attack Huayuan.

18:24.540 --> 18:26.020
I'll volunteer to fight

18:26.340 --> 18:28.340
and stage a show with the Wutuo army

18:28.500 --> 18:29.420
while giving them

18:29.660 --> 18:31.500
Rundu's Military Defense Maps

18:31.500 --> 18:32.020
in secret

18:32.260 --> 18:34.020
for them to launch a surprise attack.

18:34.180 --> 18:34.820
When Rundu

18:34.900 --> 18:35.980
pleads for help,

18:36.300 --> 18:37.540
I'll delay reinforcement.

18:37.860 --> 18:38.860
Xiao Jue won't

18:38.980 --> 18:40.380
sit back and do nothing.

18:40.940 --> 18:42.500
We'll set a trap

18:42.780 --> 18:43.660
to kill him

18:44.100 --> 18:44.620
there.

18:54.420 --> 18:55.220
Then I will

18:55.740 --> 18:56.900
start preparing.

19:10.340 --> 19:11.100
(I can't tell)

19:11.260 --> 19:12.460
(Chancellor Xu)

19:12.500 --> 19:13.380
(about He Yan yet.)

19:13.500 --> 19:14.420
(Otherwise, he would)

19:14.540 --> 19:15.980
(lose faith in me)

19:16.180 --> 19:18.340
(and pin the blame on me.)

19:18.940 --> 19:19.900
(That's his plan)

19:20.100 --> 19:20.900
(for explaining)

19:20.900 --> 19:21.780
(the Mingshui defeat.)

19:22.060 --> 19:23.060
(Luckily, I'm prepared.)

19:23.620 --> 19:25.260
(He Yan is close to the Eight Warriors)

19:25.420 --> 19:26.500
(of Fuyue Army.)

19:26.780 --> 19:28.420
(Seven now serve under me.)

19:28.620 --> 19:30.300
(One commands Rundu Garrison.)

19:30.500 --> 19:32.140
(If she is alive,)

19:32.700 --> 19:33.980
(then I can kill)

19:34.260 --> 19:36.220
(all seven warriors in Huayuan)

19:36.660 --> 19:37.780
(and use the one in Rundu)

19:37.860 --> 19:38.460
(as bait.)

19:38.660 --> 19:40.620
(That's how I manipulate her)

19:40.860 --> 19:42.060
(to go to Rundu.)

19:42.260 --> 19:42.900
(There,)

19:43.340 --> 19:45.380
(she'll meet her demise.)

19:45.980 --> 19:47.780
(If she is truly dead,)

19:48.020 --> 19:49.540
(eliminating all Eight Warriors)

19:49.860 --> 19:52.260
(still benefits my cause.)

19:52.540 --> 19:53.180
(Besides,)

19:53.420 --> 19:54.340
(I will be able)

19:54.620 --> 19:57.140
(to get rid of Xiao Jue in the process.)

19:59.020 --> 19:59.610
Young Master.

19:59.700 --> 20:00.860
Did Chancellor Xu really

20:01.220 --> 20:02.300
plan to kill you?

20:15.860 --> 20:17.060
I've passed this test.

20:18.380 --> 20:19.100
Greater storms

20:19.620 --> 20:20.860
are yet to come, though.

20:22.140 --> 20:22.710
Young Master.

20:22.980 --> 20:23.660
So what is

20:23.900 --> 20:24.700
our next move?

20:26.580 --> 20:28.260
As long as I earn his trust,

20:28.820 --> 20:29.700
I will find out

20:29.900 --> 20:30.860
his next move.

20:32.620 --> 20:33.260
If he colludes

20:33.660 --> 20:34.500
with Wutuo,

20:34.940 --> 20:35.940
we'll take precautions.

20:44.500 --> 20:45.110
Huaijin.

20:45.940 --> 20:46.540
What's wrong

20:46.540 --> 20:47.580
with you and Miss He?

20:48.220 --> 20:48.980
Why aren't you

20:49.100 --> 20:49.860
speaking at all?

20:52.340 --> 20:53.180
We are

20:54.020 --> 20:54.620
just fine.

20:55.740 --> 20:56.780
Commander Xiao.

20:57.100 --> 20:58.740
You know all the war strategies.

20:59.100 --> 20:59.980
How can you be

21:00.180 --> 21:01.380
so clueless with women?

21:02.020 --> 21:02.780
You didn't

21:03.060 --> 21:03.940
seize the opportunity

21:03.980 --> 21:04.540
in Chonghuai

21:05.060 --> 21:06.700
and grew increasingly distant.

21:07.140 --> 21:07.860
Miss He

21:07.940 --> 21:09.660
is a sensitive young lady,

21:09.860 --> 21:10.900
after all.

21:11.420 --> 21:12.340
Do you want her

21:12.500 --> 21:13.740
to feel abandoned?

21:15.740 --> 21:17.060
None of your business.

21:17.580 --> 21:18.170
I...

21:20.980 --> 21:22.140
I'm offering you advice.

21:24.940 --> 21:25.580
Seriously.

21:44.980 --> 21:50.010
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

21:52.100 --> 21:53.140
(Miss He stayed secluded)

21:53.340 --> 21:54.140
at Yuhua Temple.

21:54.700 --> 21:55.740
Besides her parents,

21:56.100 --> 21:58.020
she only met one unexpected visitor.

21:58.900 --> 22:00.380
He was not an ordinary man,

22:01.340 --> 22:03.780
but Chancellor Xu Jingfu.

22:04.380 --> 22:05.820
He sat with Miss He

22:05.980 --> 22:07.340
in the meditation room

22:07.620 --> 22:08.980
(and played chess for a while.)

22:09.780 --> 22:10.860
He Rufei.

22:11.380 --> 22:12.460
I knew it.

22:13.420 --> 22:18.070
♪Just to see you turn,
a fleeting blush in your glance♪

22:20.180 --> 22:26.000
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

22:26.610 --> 22:30.100
♪The more fate intertwines intensely♪

22:30.390 --> 22:33.250
♪The further we drift apart♪

22:33.760 --> 22:40.480
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

22:40.950 --> 22:44.170
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

22:44.560 --> 22:47.390
♪Again and again♪

22:47.860 --> 22:53.910
♪My love rests between your fingers♪

22:54.230 --> 22:58.240
♪Farewell tears blur my vision♪

22:58.390 --> 23:01.590
♪Indescribable yearnings♪

23:02.490 --> 23:08.040
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

23:09.820 --> 23:14.390
♪Perhaps I'll regret saying goodbye♪

23:16.840 --> 23:22.630
♪Maybe we can't share sorrows and joys♪

23:23.080 --> 23:26.420
♪Past memories intertwine♪

23:26.750 --> 23:29.680
♪The story rehearses itself♪

23:30.100 --> 23:36.710
♪Snow falls on windowsills,
moments fading away♪

23:37.290 --> 23:40.550
♪Before destiny is sealed♪

23:40.880 --> 23:43.960
♪Again and again♪

23:44.400 --> 23:50.610
♪My love for you burns fiercely♪

23:50.900 --> 23:54.710
♪Lifelong devotion turns into a vow♪

23:54.890 --> 23:57.980
♪That's my last wish♪

23:58.900 --> 24:05.170
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

25:13.100 --> 25:13.690
He Yan.

25:21.940 --> 25:22.620
(Commander.)

25:23.260 --> 25:24.340
Let me lead the elite squad

25:24.700 --> 25:26.700
to draw away Huyate's heavy infantry.

25:53.160 --> 25:56.170
(Xiao)

27:18.940 --> 27:19.540
Young Master.

27:20.100 --> 27:21.780
His Majesty sent Yan He
with us to Yezhou.

27:22.020 --> 27:22.700
Is Chancellor Xu

27:22.700 --> 27:23.780
behind this?

27:23.940 --> 27:25.300
Yan He is a rising star

27:26.020 --> 27:27.260
from a loyal family.

27:27.980 --> 27:28.860
I think His Majesty

27:29.220 --> 27:30.180
wants him to tag along.

27:30.780 --> 27:31.580
So, His Majesty

27:31.820 --> 27:33.340
intends to promote Yan He.

27:34.380 --> 27:35.140
Then you...

27:35.300 --> 27:35.860
It's fine.

27:36.300 --> 27:37.210
He's a military man.

27:37.540 --> 27:38.420
I'm a civil official.

27:39.020 --> 27:40.340
Why would I compete with him?

27:40.740 --> 27:41.780
Are you promoted to

27:41.780 --> 27:43.030
Director of the Ministry of War

27:43.380 --> 27:44.500
because you've earned

27:44.700 --> 27:45.660
His Majesty's trust?

27:50.940 --> 27:51.380
(Mr. Chu.)

27:52.900 --> 27:54.140
The battle in Jiyang

27:54.260 --> 27:55.580
strikes me as peculiar.

27:57.420 --> 27:59.180
Did you notice anything fishy

27:59.580 --> 28:00.420
back then?

28:01.820 --> 28:02.420
Your Majesty,

28:03.580 --> 28:04.620
before the battle,

28:05.060 --> 28:05.740
many Wutuo spies

28:05.740 --> 28:07.140
infiltrated Jiyang

28:07.580 --> 28:08.340
and even attempted

28:08.380 --> 28:09.740
to abduct the little princess.

28:10.460 --> 28:11.420
Thus, I believe that

28:11.940 --> 28:12.500
Wutuo people

28:13.020 --> 28:14.380
have been plotting this.

28:15.060 --> 28:15.640
They may

28:15.860 --> 28:17.420
wage another war against us.

28:18.180 --> 28:18.980
We must be alert.

28:20.060 --> 28:21.620
I also heard that General Fengyun

28:22.500 --> 28:25.020
saved Jiyang single-handedly.

28:25.740 --> 28:26.460
What is

28:28.980 --> 28:29.660
your opinion?

28:32.420 --> 28:33.300
In my humble opinion,

28:34.340 --> 28:36.380
General Fengyun
may have defended Jiyang,

28:36.780 --> 28:38.540
but he did leave Yezhou
without permission.

28:39.460 --> 28:41.700
Still, his achievements
outweigh his faults.

28:42.460 --> 28:44.060
I implore you to show leniency

28:44.380 --> 28:45.820
lest others grow discontent.

28:46.700 --> 28:47.260
After all,

28:47.980 --> 28:49.180
without General Fengyun

28:49.500 --> 28:50.140
and that

28:50.180 --> 28:51.180
brave young soldier,

28:51.820 --> 28:52.660
Jiyang wouldn't have

28:52.860 --> 28:53.940
regained peace so fast.

28:54.620 --> 28:55.700
Brave young soldier?

29:02.500 --> 29:03.820
Are you referring to He Yan,

29:04.540 --> 29:05.740
who single-handedly

29:06.500 --> 29:07.780
killed the Wutuo commander

29:07.860 --> 29:09.540
Huyate?

29:10.340 --> 29:10.940
Exactly.

29:13.380 --> 29:14.380
I've also heard that

29:15.740 --> 29:17.540
when Wutuo forces
attacked Yezhou Garrison,

29:18.220 --> 29:19.860
He Yan managed to

29:20.100 --> 29:21.260
crush Rida Muzi

29:21.540 --> 29:23.260
to demonstrate our prestige.

29:24.460 --> 29:25.820
To emerge distinguished

29:25.900 --> 29:27.580
from General Fengyun's towering shadow,

29:28.340 --> 29:29.420
this young man

29:30.780 --> 29:32.540
truly possesses remarkable skill.

29:36.500 --> 29:37.060
Mr. Chu,

29:37.860 --> 29:39.060
you keep asking for rewards

29:39.180 --> 29:40.220
on others' behalf.

29:40.380 --> 29:41.180
What about yourself?

29:41.900 --> 29:42.940
During the battle,

29:43.300 --> 29:44.980
you did a great job by reallocating

29:45.100 --> 29:46.300
the citizens.

29:47.660 --> 29:48.310
Tell me.

29:49.420 --> 29:50.660
What reward would you have?

29:54.460 --> 29:55.130
Your Majesty,

29:55.900 --> 29:56.580
I seek

29:57.420 --> 29:58.700
a higher position.

30:08.940 --> 30:10.260
You've always disdained

30:10.260 --> 30:11.380
such worldly pursuits

30:12.020 --> 30:13.460
and declined rewards like this.

30:14.580 --> 30:15.900
Why are you

30:16.780 --> 30:17.780
seeking promotion

30:19.500 --> 30:20.780
this time?

30:22.860 --> 30:23.380
Your Majesty,

30:24.940 --> 30:26.260
I used to believe

30:26.780 --> 30:27.620
that a minister

30:28.020 --> 30:29.340
only needed to be loyal.

30:30.140 --> 30:31.860
But through recent experience,

30:32.460 --> 30:33.220
I've realized

30:33.780 --> 30:34.660
that loyalty alone

30:34.940 --> 30:36.500
without actual power is not enough.

30:36.860 --> 30:37.540
Therefore,

30:37.540 --> 30:38.540
I seek greater influence

30:40.780 --> 30:42.140
to better serve Your Majesty

30:42.380 --> 30:43.340
in greater causes.

30:47.540 --> 30:48.660
I see.

30:51.500 --> 30:52.020
Alright then.

30:53.340 --> 30:55.260
I appoint you
as Director of the Ministry of War.

30:55.620 --> 30:56.660
Stay diligent

30:56.780 --> 30:58.100
and uphold your duties.

30:58.740 --> 30:59.620
Do not

31:00.620 --> 31:01.780
let me down.

31:05.900 --> 31:07.260
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:16.020 --> 31:16.860
A ruler

31:17.700 --> 31:18.980
never trusts others lightly.

31:19.820 --> 31:21.100
Demonstrating my capabilities

31:21.820 --> 31:22.540
and weaknesses

31:22.900 --> 31:23.540
makes me appear

31:24.300 --> 31:25.340
easily controllable

31:25.780 --> 31:26.540
to His Majesty.

31:26.980 --> 31:28.500
When I finally possess power,

31:28.940 --> 31:30.020
I can guide Wei back to

31:30.580 --> 31:31.540
righteous governance.

31:35.920 --> 31:37.140
(Imperial Edict)

31:37.140 --> 31:37.660
Young Master,

31:38.060 --> 31:39.100
forgive my boldness,

31:39.980 --> 31:41.100
but you shouldn't have asked

31:41.180 --> 31:42.140
to reward Miss He.

31:42.540 --> 31:43.380
Chancellor Xu will

31:43.420 --> 31:44.420
grow suspicious.

31:44.780 --> 31:45.820
Do you think

31:47.180 --> 31:48.780
I'm so clueless and reckless?

31:49.580 --> 31:50.940
That's not what I meant.

31:51.940 --> 31:52.500
I do

31:53.900 --> 31:54.980
harbor personal motives,

31:55.580 --> 31:57.260
but this decree serves

31:58.060 --> 31:59.260
as a stepping stone.

31:59.660 --> 32:00.980
Huayuan in jeopardy!

32:01.260 --> 32:02.540
Huayuan in jeopardy!

32:03.900 --> 32:05.340
Huayuan in jeopardy!

32:09.740 --> 32:11.540
I heard Wutuo attacked Huayuan.

32:11.780 --> 32:12.380
Is that true?

32:13.180 --> 32:14.580
They just lost in Jiyang.

32:14.740 --> 32:15.700
Another attack?

32:16.020 --> 32:17.100
It's confirmed.

32:17.780 --> 32:19.380
Someone just reported to Mr. Shen,

32:19.660 --> 32:20.580
and I overheard it.

32:21.380 --> 32:22.740
(Wutuo attacked Huayuan?)

32:23.900 --> 32:25.860
(First Jiyang, now Huayuan.)

32:26.780 --> 32:27.620
(The Wutuo army)

32:28.180 --> 32:29.100
(seems to be probing)

32:29.140 --> 32:30.300
(our military capabilities.)

32:31.020 --> 32:32.500
(They might plan to start a war.)

32:33.100 --> 32:34.500
General Feihong is leading

32:34.740 --> 32:35.640
the troops to Huayuan.

32:35.940 --> 32:37.220
He'll surely crush

32:37.420 --> 32:38.380
those Wutuo soldiers!

32:39.220 --> 32:39.900
Definitely.

32:40.140 --> 32:41.740
(He Rufei is going to Huayuan?)

32:44.850 --> 32:47.010
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

32:47.110 --> 32:51.030
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

32:51.210 --> 32:53.150
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

32:53.250 --> 32:58.180
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:10.270 --> 33:11.680
♪I've seen the mountains♪

33:11.880 --> 33:13.290
♪And trodden through ice♪

33:13.560 --> 33:16.380
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

33:16.680 --> 33:18.070
♪Destiny is my creed♪

33:18.130 --> 33:19.530
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

33:19.680 --> 33:21.480
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

33:22.680 --> 33:24.150
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

33:24.320 --> 33:25.600
♪Gazing through the mire♪

33:25.780 --> 33:28.170
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

33:28.370 --> 33:30.420
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

33:31.560 --> 33:33.390
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

33:35.350 --> 33:38.270
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

33:38.350 --> 33:41.020
♪There must always be a longing♪

33:41.470 --> 33:46.530
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

33:46.870 --> 33:48.880
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

33:49.190 --> 33:52.840
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

33:53.070 --> 33:54.960
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

33:54.990 --> 33:58.840
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

33:59.190 --> 34:01.130
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:01.320 --> 34:05.140
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:05.400 --> 34:11.150
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

34:12.040 --> 34:17.500
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

34:24.659 --> 34:27.580
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

34:27.670 --> 34:30.330
♪There must always be a longing♪

34:30.780 --> 34:35.850
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

34:36.179 --> 34:38.190
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

34:38.500 --> 34:42.150
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

34:42.389 --> 34:44.280
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

34:44.310 --> 34:48.159
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

34:48.510 --> 34:50.449
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

34:50.630 --> 34:54.449
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

34:54.710 --> 35:00.460
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

35:01.350 --> 35:06.820
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪
